## Program: LAN Configuration Using a Switch

### PC1
```bat
netsh interface ipv4 set address name="Ethernet" static 192.168.1.10 255.255.255.0
ipconfig
ping 192.168.1.11
ping 192.168.1.12
```

### PC2
```bat
netsh interface ipv4 set address name="Ethernet" static 192.168.1.11 255.255.255.0
ipconfig
ping 192.168.1.10
ping 192.168.1.12
```

### PC3
```bat
netsh interface ipv4 set address name="Ethernet" static 192.168.1.12 255.255.255.0
ipconfig
ping 192.168.1.10
ping 192.168.1.11
```

